{% schema %}{"name":"ManaChoice marketplace","settings":[{"type":"text","id":"heading","label":"Hero heading","default":"Discover more. Shop smarter."},{"type":"textarea","id":"subheading","label":"Hero subheading","default":"Trending products, useful finds, everyday essentials and deals — all in one marketplace."},{"type":"text","id":"primary_label","label":"Primary button","default":"Shop now"},{"type":"url","id":"primary_link","label":"Primary link"},{"type":"text","id":"secondary_label","label":"Secondary button","default":"Explore deals"},{"type":"url","id":"secondary_link","label":"Secondary link"},{"type":"collection","id":"featured_collection","label":"Trending collection"},{"type":"collection","id":"deals_collection","label":"Deals collection"}],"presets":[{"name":"ManaChoice marketplace"}]}{% endschema %}